// For the simulation builds only: split the prefix-network vectors of xc_add into bits, so the
// adder is ordinary feed-forward logic to the simulator (as one vector each it
// looks circular and the model runs about 30 times slower). No effect on the
// design: this file is read by the simulation builds here and nowhere else.
`verilator_config
split_var -module "xc_add" -var "G"
split_var -module "xc_add" -var "P"
